  "newYearInfoTitle5": "AKTSİİALAR",
  "newYearInfoDesc1": "Mini-oiyndarğa qatysyp, arnaiy ūpailar jinap, oiynşylardyñ jahandyq reitingındegı basty syilyqtar üşın jarysyñyz.",
  "newYearInfoDesc2": "Tapsyrmalar üşın Mausymdyq Propusk täjıribesın jäne Kämpitter aluğa bolady.\n\nKündelıktı tapsyrmalar kün saiyn jañarady, olardy arnaiy buster arqyly da jañartuğa bolady.\n\nMausymdyq Propuskty satyp alğanda arnaiy tapsyrmalarğa qoljetımdılık aşylady.",
  "@newYearInfoDesc2": {"x-locqa": {"reviewed_by_human": true, "issue_types": ["untranslated"], "original": null, "reviewer": "Sayan"}},
